    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Abstract interface for notification channel backends.</para>
<para>Implementations send alert payloads to external systems (Slack, Teams, PagerDuty, generic webhooks, local log, etc.). Each channel is invoked synchronously inside <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alerting_engine_1a387dd600c91452db51df42a2e4803e09" kindref="member">AlertingEngine::sendAlert()</ref>; expensive channels should perform their own async dispatch internally. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
